{
  "summary": "The experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal model using pca_n2000 and resnet50 encoders, compared to the concat fusion in config_016. Validation accuracy (0.5232) and F1 (0.5084) slightly decreased compared to the concat baseline (0.5266 accuracy, 0.5104 F1), suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance. However, the effectiveness of different fusion strategies remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

